  "type": "page",
  "content": "<a href=\"/#portofolio\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>PlayForCalm </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>PlayForCalm (Logic-based Zen Arcade)</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Overview:</b> PlayForCalm is a minimalist web-based game suite designed to provide a \"digital sanctuary.\" The flagship project in this suite is a custom-built <b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"163\">Sudoku Engine</b> that focuses on clean aesthetics and focus-driven gameplay, free from the distractions of typical mobile games.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Challenge (Problem):</b> Most online puzzle games are cluttered with intrusive ads, aggressive color schemes, and \"gamification\" that actually increases stress instead of reducing it. Finding a high-quality Sudoku platform that is lightweight, offline-ready, and privacy-focused is surprisingly difficult.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Solution (Engineering &amp; Logic):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"7\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Matrix Logic:</b> Instead of using heavy libraries, I built a custom <b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">Sudoku Validation Engine</b> using pure JavaScript logic to handle board generation, move validation, and difficulty scaling.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Minimalist UI (Zen Mode):</b> Developed with <b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">React 19</b>, focusing on a \"Distraction-Free\" interface. Utilizing soft shadows and muted tones to reduce eye strain during long sessions.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">State Persistence:</b> Implemented local state management so users can close their browser and return to their game exactly where they left off, without needing a database or account.</p></li></ul>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🔗Link</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://playforcalm.vercel.app/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLive Demo\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"1\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk2NywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzEtNC5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIwOGI5ZTA0In0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1-4.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1-4.png\" alt=\"1\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"2\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk2OCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzItMi5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIwOGI5ZTA0In0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/2-2.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/2-2.png\" alt=\"2\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"3\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk2OSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzMtMi5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIwOGI5ZTA0In0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/3-2.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/3-2.png\" alt=\"3\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><b data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Result:</b> A lightweight, high-performance logic app that serves as a proof-of-concept for building focused, high-utility tools without the bloat of modern web clutter.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2> <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Tech Stack</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n    React 19\n    Pure JS Algorithm\n    PWA Ready\n    Tailwind CSS\n<style>\n.kh-stack-grid {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 15px 0;\n}\n.kh-badge {\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n.kh-badge:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }\n/* PlayForCalm Colors */\n.react { background-color: #E0F7FA; color: #006064; border: 1px solid #B2EBF2; }\n.logic { background-color: #FFF3E0; color: #E65100; border: 1px solid #FFE0B2; }\n.pwa { background-color: #F3E5F5; color: #4A148C; border: 1px solid #E1BEEF; }\n.tailwind { background-color: #E0F2F1; color: #004D40; border: 1px solid #B2DFDB; }\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n        🧠 Mental Wellness\n        🧩 Logic & Puzzles\n        🌿 Minimalism\n        ⚡ Cognitive Training\n<style>\n.topic-container-horizontal {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap; /* Supaya otomatis turun kalau layar hp sempit */\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n}\n.topic-pill-v2 {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    background: #f9fafb;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #4b5563;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n.topic-pill-v2:hover {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-color: #50FFD9;\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n.topic-icon {\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n}\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n            Algorithm Design (Pure Logic)\n            100%\n            State Management (React 19)\n            100%\n            UX Design for Focus\n            100%\n<style>\n.skills-used-container {\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n.skill-item {\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.skill-info {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #374151;\n}\n.progress-bar-v2 {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 6px;\n    background-color: #e5e7eb;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n.progress-fill-v2 {\n    height: 100%;\n    background-color: #50FFD9; /* Warna Konsisten Sesuai Request */\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(80, 255, 217, 0.4); /* Efek Glow */\n    transition: width 1.5s ease-in-out;\n}\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>⭐ Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li><p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Pure Sudoku Engine:</b> Fast, responsive, and error-free logic for grid validation.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Zen Aesthetics:</b> A UI designed to lower cortisol levels and promote deep focus.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Zero-Ad Experience:</b> No trackers, no pop-ups, just pure mental exercise.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Performance Optimized:</b> Extremely small bundle size for instant loading on any connection.</p></li></ul>"
}